go 1.25.9

// Runners (runners/upstream, runners/fork) are deliberately NOT in the workspace.
// They must remain isolated islands, each pinning its own vacuum version and
// that version's transitive dependency graph. Including them here would expose
// them to workspace-wide Minimum Version Selection (especially via
// `go work sync`), which would rewrite the fork's pinned 2025-era deps to
// upstream's 2026-era deps and invalidate the benchmark.
//
// To build/test the runners, use `GOWORK=off` so they resolve from their own
// go.mod + replace directives only.
use (
	./cmd/report
	./contracts
	./internal/scenarios
)
